PETSELFTEST1
# V6-01 listening / thinking / speaking faces on the pet home screen.
# A script cannot talk to XiaoZhi, so "voice" steps force the phase the
# faces follow (the board's UpdateVoiceFace path, settle + dwell included).
# A real BOOT conversation still needs a person (see the PR test plan).
# Counted from "mark begin" (see tools/selftest_report.py).
# expect min:face=listening 1
# expect min:face=thinking 1
# expect min:face=speaking 1
# expect min:face=none 1
# Four face changes = four partials; the fast flips in between never reach
# the panel (count PET_VOICE_FACE lines: exactly 4). No exact partial count:
# the once-a-minute status band refresh may add one while no face is shown.
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# expect selftest_done 1
# expect max_partial_ms 2500
# Quiet prompts while testing (RAM only, this boot).
volume 15
# Start as soon as XiaoZhi is idle (Wi-Fi up, activated), not after a
# fixed 20 s; the pet toggle below still retries.
waitidle 60000
pet
wait 6000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 6000
hold press 1500 6000
mark begin
voice listen
wait 3000
voice think
wait 3000
voice speak
wait 4000
# Phases flipping faster than the settle time: no refresh storm.
voice listen
wait 200
voice speak
wait 200
voice listen
wait 200
voice speak
wait 3000
voice off
wait 4000
pet
wait 4000
end
